o if my result is &quot;Enemy&quot;?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-«Rdkhtkclb»\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-«R5khtkclb»\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div></section><div class=\"text-center pb-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-8\"><a href=\"mailto:care.msgreplier@gmail.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>Suggestions &amp; Feedback</a></div></div></div><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[#110f0f] border-t border-[#d4c3ab]/10 text-white py-16 px-4\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Work Sans&quot;, sans-serif\"><style>\n        .font-heading {\n          font-family: 'Unbounded', sans-serif !important;\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16 items-start\"><div class=\"space-y-6 flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><a class=\